KONOHAGAKURE — UCHIHA CLAN REGULATIONS
CLASSIFICATION: Sensitive — Council and Hokage's office.

The Uchiha are a founding clan of the Hidden Leaf, descended from those who fought beside Madara and Hashirama at the village's birth. They are keepers of the Sharingan dojutsu.

Regulations:
- Sharingan use is governed under the separate Sharingan Use Policy; the eye and its secrets are village-protected.
- The Konoha Military Police Force was historically a clan institution charged with village law enforcement.
- Clan matters are adjudicated by the clan head in consultation with the Village Council.
- Records concerning the fate of the Uchiha clan (the massacre) are held under classified seal; disclosure is restricted.

The surviving registered member, Uchiha Sasuke, retains clan rights and obligations.
Maintained under Council authority.
